{"module":"before-race","voice":"male","duration":486.8,"segments":[{"el":"title","text":"Before race: where the fear came from","start":0.0,"end":2.31,"words":[[0.05,0.34],[0.34,0.7],[0.96,1.17],[1.17,1.32],[1.32,1.54],[1.54,1.83],[1.83,2.12]]},{"el":"intro","text":"People often ask why the targeting of Black, Brown and Native people has lasted so long, and whether some forgotten origin explains it.","start":3.11,"end":12.5,"words":[[3.15,3.56],[3.56,3.88],[3.88,4.12],[4.12,4.36],[4.36,4.53],[4.53,5.09],[5.09,5.26],[5.26,5.66],[5.94,6.35],[6.35,6.59],[6.59,7.08],[7.08,7.48],[7.48,7.72],[7.72,8.21],[8.21,8.45],[8.45,8.78],[9.06,9.3],[9.3,9.63],[9.63,9.87],[9.87,10.44],[10.44,11.0],[11.0,11.73],[11.73,11.97]]},{"el":"intro","text":"The record gives a clearer answer: modern race is recent, it was written into law on purpose, and it has been defended by whatever argument was handy, including scripture and science.","start":12.85,"end":24.93,"words":[[12.9,13.05],[13.05,13.44],[13.44,13.74],[13.74,13.89],[13.89,14.35],[14.35,14.73],[15.0,15.38],[15.38,15.68],[15.68,15.83],[15.83,16.37],[16.63,16.78],[16.78,17.01],[17.01,17.39],[17.39,17.7],[17.7,17.85],[17.85,18.0],[18.0,18.46],[18.73,18.95],[18.95,19.11],[19.11,19.33],[19.33,19.56],[19.56,20.17],[20.17,20.4],[20.4,20.86],[20.86,21.47],[21.47,21.69],[21.69,22.15],[22.42,23.03],[23.03,23.63],[23.63,23.86],[23.86,24.4]]},{"el":"h0","text":"The ancient world sorted people differently","start":25.28,"end":28.13,"words":[[25.33,25.49],[25.49,26.07],[26.07,26.39],[26.39,26.8],[26.8,27.21],[27.21,27.95]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Slavery is ancient, but for most of history it was not based on skin color.","start":28.83,"end":34.62,"words":[[28.87,29.51],[29.51,29.67],[29.67,30.31],[30.59,30.83],[30.83,30.98],[30.98,31.38],[31.38,31.54],[31.54,32.1],[32.1,32.26],[32.26,32.5],[32.5,32.74],[32.74,33.14],[33.14,33.3],[33.3,33.61],[33.61,34.01]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Greeks, Romans, Egyptians, Africans, Arabs and Europeans enslaved people taken in war, sold for debt, or born to enslaved mothers, and enslaved people came from every region.","start":34.97,"end":48.41,"words":[[35.06,35.53],[35.8,36.41],[36.68,37.45],[37.72,38.42],[38.69,39.07],[39.07,39.3],[39.3,40.07],[40.07,40.69],[40.69,41.08],[41.08,41.54],[41.54,41.69],[41.69,41.92],[42.19,42.58],[42.58,42.73],[42.73,43.04],[43.31,43.39],[43.39,43.62],[43.62,43.77],[43.77,44.39],[44.39,44.85],[45.12,45.35],[45.35,45.97],[45.97,46.36],[46.36,46.66],[46.66,46.97],[46.97,47.28],[47.28,47.82]]},{"el":"s0","text":"The English word slave itself comes from Slav, because so many Eastern Europeans were enslaved in the Middle Ages.","start":48.76,"end":56.76,"words":[[48.81,48.97],[48.97,49.45],[49.45,49.69],[49.69,50.09],[50.09,50.58],[50.58,50.9],[50.9,51.22],[51.22,51.62],[51.9,52.3],[52.3,52.54],[52.54,52.87],[52.87,53.27],[53.27,54.07],[54.07,54.23],[54.23,54.87],[54.87,55.04],[55.04,55.2],[55.2,55.6],[55.6,56.16]]},{"el":"s0","text":"Historian Frank Snowden showed that Greek and Roman writers described Africans with curiosity and sometimes admiration, without the idea of a fixed racial ranking.","start":57.11,"end":68.15,"words":[[57.15,57.82],[57.82,58.2],[58.2,58.72],[58.72,59.02],[59.02,59.25],[59.25,59.55],[59.55,59.78],[59.78,60.23],[60.23,60.68],[60.68,61.35],[61.35,61.95],[61.95,62.18],[62.18,63.08],[63.08,63.3],[63.3,63.9],[63.9,64.73],[64.99,65.44],[65.44,65.59],[65.59,65.97],[65.97,66.12],[66.12,66.27],[66.27,66.64],[66.64,67.09],[67.09,67.62]]},{"el":"h1","text":"Race was written into law (1452–1705)","start":69.05,"end":73.25,"words":[[69.1,69.43],[69.43,69.68],[69.68,70.09],[70.09,70.42],[70.42,70.58],[70.58,72.89]]},{"el":"s1","text":"The idea that some people are naturally meant to be owned was spelled out step by step:","start":73.95,"end":80.37,"words":[[74.0,74.19],[74.19,74.65],[74.65,74.93],[74.93,75.21],[75.21,75.67],[75.67,75.76],[75.76,76.6],[76.6,76.97],[76.97,77.16],[77.16,77.34],[77.34,77.71],[77.71,77.99],[77.99,78.45],[78.45,78.73],[78.73,79.1],[79.1,79.38],[79.38,79.84]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1452–1455: Pope Nicholas V's bulls Dum Diversas and Romanus Pontifex authorized Portugal's king to conquer “Saracens and pagans” and reduce them to perpetual slavery.","start":80.72,"end":96.58,"words":[[80.73,83.5],[83.83,84.21],[84.21,84.88],[84.88,85.17],[85.17,85.55],[85.55,85.83],[85.83,86.6],[86.6,86.88],[86.88,87.65],[87.65,88.6],[88.6,89.36],[89.36,90.22],[90.22,90.51],[90.51,90.7],[90.7,91.17],[91.17,91.94],[91.94,92.22],[92.22,92.89],[92.89,93.18],[93.18,93.75],[93.75,94.03],[94.03,94.22],[94.22,95.08],[95.08,95.94]]},{"el":"s1","text":"Portugal's African slave trade grew under them.","start":96.93,"end":99.79,"words":[[96.98,97.55],[97.55,97.99],[97.99,98.3],[98.3,98.62],[98.62,98.81],[98.81,99.06],[99.06,99.31]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1493: Inter caetera gave Spain lands “discovered” in the Americas.","start":100.14,"end":105.27,"words":[[100.14,101.22],[101.47,101.76],[101.76,102.19],[102.19,102.48],[102.48,102.84],[102.84,103.2],[103.2,103.78],[103.78,103.92],[103.92,104.07],[104.07,104.72]]},{"el":"s1","text":"These bulls became the Doctrine of Discovery, which the U.S. Supreme Court adopted in Johnson v. M'Intosh (1823) to deny Native nations full ownership of their land.","start":105.62,"end":117.87,"words":[[105.67,105.9],[105.9,106.21],[106.21,106.68],[106.68,106.83],[106.83,107.37],[107.37,107.53],[107.53,108.3],[108.57,108.88],[108.88,109.04],[109.04,109.43],[109.81,110.28],[110.28,110.51],[110.51,111.05],[111.05,111.21],[111.21,111.75],[111.75,111.98],[112.37,112.91],[112.91,114.0],[114.27,114.42],[114.42,114.81],[114.81,115.27],[115.27,115.82],[115.82,116.05],[116.05,116.59],[116.59,116.75],[116.75,116.98],[116.98,117.36]]},{"el":"s1","text":"The Vatican repudiated the doctrine in 2023.","start":118.22,"end":122.2,"words":[[118.27,118.41],[118.41,118.89],[118.89,119.79],[119.79,119.93],[119.93,120.41],[120.41,120.55],[120.55,121.65]]},{"el":"s1","text":"The Supreme Court has not.","start":122.55,"end":124.41,"words":[[122.6,122.75],[122.75,123.19],[123.19,123.41],[123.41,123.63],[123.63,123.92]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1662: Virginia ruled that a child follows the condition of the mother, so children of enslaved women, including children of their enslavers, were born enslaved.","start":124.76,"end":136.31,"words":[[124.81,125.97],[126.23,126.81],[126.81,127.11],[127.11,127.32],[127.32,127.47],[127.47,127.91],[127.91,128.35],[128.35,128.49],[128.49,129.07],[129.07,129.22],[129.22,129.37],[129.37,129.73],[129.99,130.2],[130.2,130.79],[130.79,130.93],[130.93,131.52],[131.52,131.96],[132.21,132.79],[132.79,133.38],[133.38,133.52],[133.52,133.74],[133.74,134.47],[134.73,134.87],[134.87,135.09],[135.09,135.75]]},{"el":"s1","text":"1667–1705: Virginia declared that baptism does not free a slave (1667), that killing an enslaved person during “correction” was not a felony (1669), banned interracial marriage (1691), and gathered everything into the 1705 slave codes.","start":136.66,"end":157.76,"words":[[136.71,139.44],[139.72,140.34],[140.34,140.89],[140.89,141.12],[141.12,141.75],[141.75,141.98],[141.98,142.21],[142.21,142.45],[142.45,142.6],[142.6,142.99],[142.99,144.48],[144.75,144.99],[144.99,145.38],[145.38,145.53],[145.53,146.16],[146.16,146.55],[146.55,147.09],[147.09,147.72],[147.72,147.95],[147.95,148.19],[148.19,148.34],[148.34,148.81],[148.81,150.22],[150.49,150.8],[150.8,151.58],[151.58,152.05],[152.05,153.38],[153.65,153.89],[153.89,154.28],[154.28,154.82],[154.82,155.13],[155.13,155.29],[155.29,156.38],[156.38,156.77],[156.77,157.24]]},{"el":"s1","text":"France's Code Noir (1685) did the same for its colonies.","start":158.11,"end":162.54,"words":[[158.15,158.65],[158.65,158.94],[158.94,159.15],[159.15,160.23],[160.48,160.7],[160.7,160.84],[160.84,161.13],[161.13,161.27],[161.27,161.49],[161.49,162.07]]},{"el":"h2","text":"Dividing people who might unite","start":163.44,"end":165.62,"words":[[163.49,164.11],[164.11,164.5],[164.5,164.65],[164.65,164.96],[164.96,165.43]]},{"el":"s2","text":"In 1676, Bacon's Rebellion brought white indentured servants and enslaved Africans together in an armed revolt against Virginia's government.","start":166.32,"end":176.67,"words":[[166.37,166.53],[166.53,167.98],[168.25,168.78],[168.78,169.39],[169.39,169.7],[169.7,170.01],[170.01,170.7],[170.7,171.23],[171.23,171.46],[171.46,172.07],[172.07,172.68],[172.68,173.14],[173.14,173.3],[173.3,173.45],[173.45,173.68],[173.68,174.21],[174.21,174.67],[174.67,175.36],[175.36,176.13]]},{"el":"s2","text":"In the decades that followed, Virginia's laws gave poor white people small privileges (freedom dues, the right to bear arms, the right to strike a Black person) while taking rights away from all Black people, free or enslaved.","start":177.02,"end":192.28,"words":[[177.07,177.23],[177.23,177.39],[177.39,177.96],[177.96,178.21],[178.21,178.78],[179.06,179.8],[179.8,180.04],[180.04,180.37],[180.37,180.61],[180.61,180.94],[180.94,181.35],[181.35,181.67],[181.67,182.57],[182.57,183.06],[183.06,183.46],[183.75,183.91],[183.91,184.24],[184.24,184.4],[184.4,184.65],[184.65,184.97],[185.26,185.42],[185.42,185.75],[185.75,185.91],[185.91,186.4],[186.4,186.56],[186.56,186.89],[186.89,187.29],[187.58,187.91],[187.91,188.39],[188.39,188.8],[188.8,189.13],[189.13,189.45],[189.45,189.62],[189.62,189.94],[189.94,190.43],[190.72,190.96],[190.96,191.04],[191.04,191.78]]},{"el":"s2","text":"That the laws changed is documented.","start":192.63,"end":194.96,"words":[[192.67,192.86],[192.86,192.98],[192.98,193.16],[193.16,193.64],[193.64,193.76],[193.76,194.49]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Historian Edmund Morgan argued that the elite used race on purpose to keep poor white and Black people from uniting again.","start":195.31,"end":204.0,"words":[[195.35,196.15],[196.15,196.69],[196.69,197.14],[197.14,197.59],[197.59,197.86],[197.86,198.03],[198.03,198.39],[198.39,198.75],[198.75,199.11],[199.11,199.29],[199.29,199.74],[199.74,199.92],[199.92,200.18],[200.18,200.45],[200.45,200.81],[200.81,201.08],[201.08,201.44],[201.44,201.89],[201.89,202.24],[202.24,202.96],[202.96,203.41]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Others think the shift had more to do with the falling cost of enslaved Africans compared with English servants.","start":204.35,"end":211.28,"words":[[204.4,204.72],[204.72,205.04],[205.04,205.2],[205.2,205.52],[205.52,205.76],[205.76,205.91],[205.91,206.07],[206.07,206.23],[206.23,206.47],[206.47,206.63],[206.63,207.03],[207.03,207.35],[207.35,207.51],[207.51,208.14],[208.14,208.78],[208.78,209.34],[209.34,209.58],[209.58,210.05],[210.05,210.69]]},{"el":"s2","text":"Most agree the effect was the same.","start":211.63,"end":214.23,"words":[[211.68,212.06],[212.06,212.36],[212.36,212.51],[212.51,212.89],[212.89,213.11],[213.11,213.27],[213.27,213.64]]},{"el":"h3","text":"The practice came first, the ideas followed","start":215.13,"end":219.45,"words":[[215.18,215.41],[215.41,216.22],[216.22,216.68],[216.68,217.25],[217.66,217.89],[217.89,218.58],[218.58,219.26]]},{"el":"s3","text":"In 1944 the Trinidadian historian Eric Williams wrote that “slavery was not born of racism: rather, racism was the consequence of slavery.”","start":220.15,"end":231.15,"words":[[220.19,220.35],[220.35,221.39],[221.39,221.55],[221.55,222.51],[222.51,223.23],[223.23,223.55],[223.55,224.1],[224.1,224.42],[224.42,224.66],[224.66,225.3],[225.3,225.54],[225.54,225.78],[225.78,226.02],[226.02,226.18],[226.18,226.9],[227.18,227.58],[227.86,228.49],[228.49,228.73],[228.73,228.89],[228.89,229.69],[229.69,229.85],[229.85,230.57]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Ibram X. Kendi's Stamped from the Beginning (2016) traces the same pattern over five centuries: racist ideas were developed to defend policies that were already profitable.","start":231.5,"end":243.05,"words":[[231.55,231.9],[231.9,232.19],[232.54,232.97],[232.97,233.4],[233.4,233.68],[233.68,233.82],[233.82,234.32],[234.32,235.25],[235.5,235.99],[235.99,236.14],[236.14,236.42],[236.42,236.78],[236.78,237.06],[237.06,237.35],[237.35,238.06],[238.31,238.81],[238.81,239.23],[239.23,239.37],[239.37,239.94],[239.94,240.09],[240.09,240.51],[240.51,241.01],[241.01,241.22],[241.22,241.37],[241.37,241.79],[241.79,242.58]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Thomas Jefferson, who enslaved more than 600 people over his life, offered Black inferiority “as a suspicion only” in his Notes on the State of Virginia (1785).","start":243.4,"end":254.96,"words":[[243.46,243.83],[243.83,244.49],[244.75,244.9],[244.9,245.49],[245.49,245.64],[245.64,245.86],[245.86,246.67],[246.67,247.04],[247.04,247.34],[247.34,247.56],[247.56,247.93],[248.19,248.48],[248.48,248.78],[248.78,249.74],[249.74,249.89],[249.89,250.04],[250.04,250.63],[250.63,251.0],[251.0,251.14],[251.14,251.37],[251.37,251.73],[251.73,251.88],[251.88,252.03],[252.03,252.4],[252.4,252.55],[252.55,253.14],[253.14,254.39]]},{"el":"s3","text":"Within decades, “scientists” were measuring skulls to prove it (see the module on science).","start":255.31,"end":261.01,"words":[[255.36,255.74],[255.74,256.34],[256.6,257.35],[257.35,257.5],[257.5,258.03],[258.03,258.41],[258.41,258.56],[258.56,258.86],[258.86,259.01],[259.01,259.16],[259.16,259.31],[259.31,259.76],[259.76,259.91],[259.91,260.44]]},{"el":"h4","text":"What the fear was really about","start":261.91,"end":264.35,"words":[[261.96,262.27],[262.27,262.48],[262.48,262.79],[262.79,263.1],[263.1,263.62],[263.62,264.14]]},{"el":"s4","text":"The fear was real.","start":265.05,"end":266.35,"words":[[265.1,265.22],[265.22,265.41],[265.41,265.59],[265.59,265.89]]},{"el":"s4","text":"It was fear of revolt, of revenge, and of losing power at the ballot box:","start":266.7,"end":272.68,"words":[[266.75,266.92],[266.92,267.18],[267.18,267.44],[267.44,267.61],[267.61,268.29],[268.59,268.76],[268.76,269.45],[269.75,270.0],[270.0,270.17],[270.17,270.6],[270.6,270.94],[270.94,271.11],[271.11,271.28],[271.28,271.71],[271.71,272.14]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Haiti, 1791–1804: enslaved people overthrew French rule and founded the first free Black republic.","start":273.03,"end":281.05,"words":[[273.07,273.5],[273.76,275.84],[276.09,276.67],[276.67,277.03],[277.03,277.53],[277.53,277.97],[277.97,278.18],[278.18,278.4],[278.4,278.9],[278.9,279.04],[279.04,279.33],[279.33,279.55],[279.55,279.84],[279.84,280.48]]},{"el":"s4","text":"France later forced Haiti to pay 150 million francs (reduced to 90 million) for its own freedom, a debt Haiti paid off over about 120 years.","start":281.4,"end":290.87,"words":[[281.45,281.77],[281.77,282.08],[282.08,282.33],[282.33,282.64],[282.64,282.77],[282.77,282.95],[282.95,284.02],[284.02,284.39],[284.39,284.77],[284.77,285.21],[285.21,285.33],[285.33,285.71],[285.71,286.08],[286.3,286.43],[286.43,286.61],[286.61,286.8],[286.8,287.24],[287.46,287.58],[287.58,287.77],[287.77,288.08],[288.08,288.33],[288.33,288.46],[288.46,288.71],[288.71,289.02],[289.02,290.15],[290.15,290.46]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Nat Turner's rebellion, 1831: afterward, Virginia and other states tightened bans on teaching Black people to read and on Black preachers and gatherings.","start":291.22,"end":300.95,"words":[[291.27,291.48],[291.48,291.83],[291.83,292.46],[292.71,293.63],[293.87,294.44],[294.68,295.25],[295.25,295.46],[295.46,295.67],[295.67,296.09],[296.09,296.59],[296.59,296.87],[296.87,297.01],[297.01,297.43],[297.43,297.71],[297.71,298.07],[298.07,298.21],[298.21,298.42],[298.42,298.63],[298.63,298.77],[298.77,299.05],[299.05,299.55],[299.55,299.76],[299.76,300.39]]},{"el":"s4","text":"Reconstruction, 1867–1877: Black men voted and held office, and South Carolina's lower house had a Black majority.","start":301.3,"end":311.22,"words":[[301.35,302.36],[302.61,305.21],[305.46,305.75],[305.75,305.96],[305.96,306.4],[306.4,306.61],[306.61,306.9],[306.9,307.26],[307.52,307.73],[307.73,308.02],[308.02,308.74],[308.74,309.03],[309.03,309.32],[309.32,309.54],[309.54,309.68],[309.68,309.97],[309.97,310.69]]},{"el":"s4","text":"White-supremacist violence ended it, including the 1898 coup in Wilmington, North Carolina, where an elected biracial government was overthrown by force.","start":311.57,"end":323.7,"words":[[311.62,312.82],[312.82,313.46],[313.46,313.86],[313.86,314.1],[314.38,315.03],[315.03,315.19],[315.19,316.39],[316.39,316.63],[316.63,316.79],[316.79,317.59],[317.87,318.11],[318.11,318.91],[319.19,319.43],[319.43,319.59],[319.59,320.15],[320.15,320.87],[320.87,321.59],[321.59,321.83],[321.83,322.55],[322.55,322.79],[322.79,323.11]]},{"el":"s4","text":"“Replacement”: Madison Grant's The Passing of the Great Race (1916) warned that white Americans were being outbred.","start":324.05,"end":331.26,"words":[[324.1,324.9],[325.13,325.59],[325.59,325.99],[325.99,326.12],[326.12,326.45],[326.45,326.59],[326.59,326.72],[326.72,327.05],[327.05,327.31],[327.31,328.24],[328.47,328.74],[328.74,328.93],[328.93,329.2],[329.2,329.79],[329.79,329.93],[329.93,330.26],[330.26,330.79]]},{"el":"s4","text":"It helped pass the 1924 immigration quotas.","start":331.61,"end":335.46,"words":[[331.67,331.82],[331.82,332.18],[332.18,332.39],[332.39,332.53],[332.53,333.61],[333.61,334.32],[334.32,334.9]]},{"el":"s4","text":"The same fear, renamed the “Great Replacement,” was cited by the killers in El Paso (2019) and Buffalo (2022).","start":335.81,"end":344.08,"words":[[335.86,336.0],[336.0,336.28],[336.28,336.57],[336.81,337.31],[337.31,337.45],[337.45,337.81],[337.81,338.66],[338.66,338.87],[338.87,339.3],[339.3,339.51],[339.51,339.65],[339.65,340.01],[340.01,340.15],[340.15,340.29],[340.29,340.65],[340.65,341.57],[341.82,342.03],[342.03,342.53],[342.53,343.59]]},{"el":"h5","text":"How scripture was used, and misused","start":344.98,"end":348.37,"words":[[345.02,345.32],[345.32,346.1],[346.1,346.39],[346.39,346.87],[347.21,347.51],[347.51,348.19]]},{"el":"s5","text":"The “Curse of Ham.”","start":349.07,"end":350.18,"words":[[349.11,349.23],[349.23,349.39],[349.39,349.5],[349.5,349.73]]},{"el":"s5","text":"In Genesis 9:20–27, Noah curses Canaan, Ham's son, to be a servant.","start":350.53,"end":356.25,"words":[[350.57,350.7],[350.7,351.21],[351.21,352.77],[352.99,353.25],[353.25,353.57],[353.57,353.96],[354.19,354.45],[354.45,354.71],[354.93,355.06],[355.06,355.19],[355.19,355.32],[355.32,355.77]]},{"el":"s5","text":"The text says nothing about skin color or Africa.","start":356.6,"end":359.72,"words":[[356.64,356.78],[356.78,357.13],[357.13,357.34],[357.34,357.69],[357.69,358.04],[358.04,358.32],[358.32,358.6],[358.6,358.67],[358.67,359.16]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Linking the curse to dark skin came much later and was spread by interpreters across several traditions.","start":360.07,"end":366.23,"words":[[360.11,360.54],[360.54,360.68],[360.68,360.9],[360.9,361.04],[361.04,361.26],[361.26,361.54],[361.54,361.83],[361.83,362.11],[362.11,362.47],[362.47,362.68],[362.68,362.89],[362.89,363.25],[363.25,363.46],[363.46,364.18],[364.18,364.53],[364.53,364.96],[364.96,365.67]]},{"el":"s5","text":"By the 1800s it was a standard pro-slavery argument in American pulpits.","start":366.58,"end":372.17,"words":[[366.63,366.84],[366.84,366.99],[366.99,367.92],[367.92,368.06],[368.06,368.27],[368.27,368.42],[368.42,368.92],[368.92,369.78],[369.78,370.35],[370.35,370.49],[370.49,371.07],[371.07,371.64]]},{"el":"s5","text":"The “Slave Bible.”","start":372.52,"end":373.98,"words":[[372.56,372.7],[372.7,373.02],[373.02,373.48]]},{"el":"s5","text":"In 1807 a British missionary society printed Select Parts of the Holy Bible, for the Use of the Negro Slaves.","start":374.33,"end":382.85,"words":[[374.38,374.54],[374.54,375.5],[375.5,375.66],[375.66,376.14],[376.14,376.79],[376.79,377.43],[377.43,377.99],[377.99,378.48],[378.48,378.8],[378.8,378.96],[378.96,379.12],[379.12,379.52],[379.52,380.08],[380.36,380.53],[380.53,380.69],[380.69,380.93],[380.93,381.09],[381.09,381.25],[381.25,381.73],[381.73,382.29]]},{"el":"s5","text":"It cut most of the Old Testament, including the Exodus story of freedom from slavery, and kept passages like “Servants, be obedient to them that are your masters.”","start":383.2,"end":395.58,"words":[[383.25,383.42],[383.42,383.67],[383.67,384.1],[384.1,384.27],[384.27,384.44],[384.44,384.78],[384.78,385.63],[385.93,386.61],[386.61,386.78],[386.78,387.37],[387.37,387.8],[387.8,387.97],[387.97,388.48],[388.48,388.82],[388.82,389.58],[389.88,390.14],[390.14,390.48],[390.48,391.16],[391.16,391.5],[391.5,392.18],[392.48,392.65],[392.65,393.41],[393.41,393.58],[393.58,393.84],[393.84,394.09],[394.09,394.18],[394.18,394.35],[394.35,394.94]]},{"el":"s5","text":"Scripture was also the strongest weapon against slavery: enslaved people sang of Moses and Exodus, and abolitionists from Frederick Douglass to the Black church built their case on it.","start":395.93,"end":407.17,"words":[[395.98,396.55],[396.55,396.76],[396.76,397.12],[397.12,397.26],[397.26,397.89],[397.89,398.25],[398.25,398.67],[398.67,399.31],[399.56,400.12],[400.12,400.48],[400.48,400.69],[400.69,400.83],[400.83,401.25],[401.25,401.47],[401.47,402.03],[402.28,402.49],[402.49,403.34],[403.34,403.62],[403.62,404.19],[404.19,404.61],[404.61,404.76],[404.76,404.9],[404.9,405.18],[405.18,405.53],[405.53,405.82],[405.82,406.03],[406.03,406.31],[406.31,406.45],[406.45,406.67]]},{"el":"h6","text":"The Book of Enoch and modern race myths","start":408.07,"end":410.57,"words":[[408.12,408.29],[408.29,408.54],[408.54,408.7],[408.7,409.03],[409.03,409.28],[409.28,409.69],[409.69,410.02],[410.02,410.35]]},{"el":"s6","text":"1 Enoch is an ancient Jewish book that is part of the Bible of the Ethiopian Orthodox Church; fragments were found among the Dead Sea Scrolls, and the Letter of Jude (verses 14–15) quotes it.","start":411.27,"end":424.1,"words":[[411.32,411.55],[411.55,411.86],[411.86,412.02],[412.02,412.17],[412.17,412.71],[412.71,413.1],[413.1,413.33],[413.33,413.56],[413.56,413.72],[413.72,413.95],[413.95,414.1],[414.1,414.26],[414.26,414.72],[414.72,414.88],[414.88,415.03],[415.03,415.81],[415.81,416.35],[416.35,416.81],[417.08,417.78],[417.78,417.94],[417.94,418.32],[418.32,418.63],[418.63,418.79],[418.79,419.02],[419.02,419.17],[419.17,419.79],[420.06,420.3],[420.3,420.45],[420.45,420.76],[420.76,420.91],[420.91,421.22],[421.22,421.61],[421.61,422.62],[422.89,423.35],[423.35,423.58]]},{"el":"s6","text":"It tells how angels called the Watchers came to earth, taught forbidden knowledge, and fathered giants (the Nephilim of Genesis 6).","start":424.45,"end":432.71,"words":[[424.49,424.64],[424.64,424.95],[424.95,425.17],[425.17,425.78],[425.78,426.09],[426.09,426.24],[426.24,426.7],[426.7,427.0],[427.0,427.15],[427.15,427.38],[427.65,427.88],[427.88,428.41],[428.41,428.94],[429.21,429.44],[429.44,429.82],[429.82,430.43],[430.43,430.58],[430.58,431.12],[431.12,431.27],[431.27,431.88],[431.88,432.26]]},{"el":"s6","text":"It contains no teaching about race.","start":433.06,"end":435.49,"words":[[433.11,433.24],[433.24,433.76],[433.76,433.96],[433.96,434.35],[434.35,434.67],[434.67,435.0]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Modern movements have still built race stories on Genesis and Enoch.","start":435.84,"end":440.29,"words":[[435.88,436.26],[436.26,436.86],[436.86,437.09],[437.09,437.39],[437.39,437.69],[437.69,437.99],[437.99,438.45],[438.45,438.6],[438.6,439.2],[439.2,439.43],[439.43,439.8]]},{"el":"s6","text":"We describe them so you can recognize them, not because they are true:","start":440.64,"end":445.41,"words":[[440.7,440.86],[440.86,441.52],[441.52,441.76],[441.76,442.01],[442.01,442.17],[442.17,442.41],[442.41,443.15],[443.15,443.48],[443.76,444.01],[444.01,444.42],[444.42,444.66],[444.66,444.74],[444.74,445.07]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Christian Identity “two-seedline” theology, a white-supremacist doctrine claiming Jews and people of color descend from the serpent or from “pre-Adamic” races.","start":445.76,"end":456.07,"words":[[445.81,446.42],[446.42,447.1],[447.1,447.78],[447.78,448.53],[448.8,448.95],[448.95,450.09],[450.09,450.62],[450.62,451.15],[451.15,451.45],[451.45,451.68],[451.68,452.06],[452.06,452.21],[452.21,452.51],[452.51,452.96],[452.96,453.27],[453.27,453.42],[453.42,453.87],[453.87,453.95],[453.95,454.25],[454.25,455.01],[455.01,455.54]]},{"el":"s6","text":"The Nation of Islam's story of Yakub, which teaches that a scientist named Yakub created white people thousands of years ago.","start":456.42,"end":464.44,"words":[[456.48,456.62],[456.62,457.05],[457.05,457.19],[457.19,457.62],[457.62,457.98],[457.98,458.12],[458.12,458.55],[458.8,459.09],[459.09,459.52],[459.52,459.73],[459.73,459.88],[459.88,460.52],[460.52,460.88],[460.88,461.24],[461.24,461.88],[461.88,462.17],[462.17,462.52],[462.52,463.1],[463.1,463.24],[463.24,463.53],[463.53,463.88]]},{"el":"s6","text":"Some Hebrew Israelite groups teach that Black, Hispanic and Native Americans are the true Israelites and that others are cursed.","start":464.79,"end":473.6,"words":[[464.83,465.09],[465.09,465.52],[465.52,466.3],[466.3,466.73],[466.73,467.07],[467.07,467.33],[467.33,467.76],[468.07,468.76],[468.76,469.02],[469.02,469.53],[469.53,470.31],[470.31,470.4],[470.4,470.57],[470.57,470.83],[470.83,471.69],[471.69,471.95],[471.95,472.21],[472.21,472.55],[472.55,472.64],[472.64,473.07]]},{"el":"s6","text":"These stories mirror each other: each claims race is ancient, fixed and cosmic.","start":473.95,"end":478.95,"words":[[474.0,474.21],[474.21,474.61],[474.61,474.88],[474.88,475.09],[475.09,475.36],[475.59,475.8],[475.8,476.2],[476.2,476.47],[476.47,476.61],[476.61,477.15],[477.39,477.73],[477.73,477.93],[477.93,478.4]]},{"el":"s6","text":"The historical record shows the opposite: race is recent, made by people, and can be unmade.","start":479.3,"end":485.94,"words":[[479.35,479.49],[479.49,480.23],[480.23,480.6],[480.6,480.9],[480.9,481.04],[481.04,481.56],[481.82,482.11],[482.11,482.26],[482.26,482.78],[483.04,483.33],[483.33,483.55],[483.55,484.0],[484.25,484.48],[484.48,484.7],[484.7,484.85],[484.85,485.36]]}]}